# Training exercise for the sample airport: a busy evening, a lost child, a medical case and a fire
# alarm in baggage claim, with the heat rising outside. Start it on a drill server:
#   program/run-drill.bat airport 8081 ..\examples\airport-fire.drill     (Windows)
#   program/run-drill.sh airport 8081 ../examples/airport-fire.drill      (macOS, Linux)
# then open http://<this-pc>:8081/ - every screen shows DRILL; nothing reaches the real venue.
# One event a line: MM:SS after the start, then the command (see the guide, Drills).
00:10 say Exercise started: evening departure bank, Terminal 1
00:30 count CHECKIN-1 1150
01:00 move OUTSIDE CURB-1 400
01:30 count SEC-1 420
02:00 lost GATE-A Boy, about 7, red jacket, speaks English
03:00 incident MEDICAL DUTYFREE-1 Elderly man feeling faint
04:00 weather 42 30
05:00 count GATE-A 1450
06:00 alarm BAGGAGE-1 smoke detector in the baggage hall
08:00 sos SEC-1 fight in the queue, one person hurt
10:00 say Exercise ends in 2 minutes: finish your actions and write down what you did
12:00 say Exercise over - thank you
